    ('bcca9a55-a25b-5031-af6e-a8d0069cf378', '49033b5b-446d-5796-ac43-ffea0db385d5', 1, 'Offer a ride', 'As a student with a car, I want to offer seats on my drive to campus, so that I can split fuel.', 'Given I offer 3 seats from Kothur at 8 am, when others search, then my ride shows with 3 seats.', 'must', 'c83a4faa-9e45-5c46-a752-a709c2ae33c7', now() - interval '44640 minutes'),
    ('db28bd7a-63ba-511c-a718-a676b9edd5c2', '49033b5b-446d-5796-ac43-ffea0db385d5', 4, 'Find a ride', 'As a student, I want to find rides from my area, so that I don''t take two buses.', 'Given rides from my area tomorrow, when I search, then I see them sorted by time.', 'must', '123e4c81-7544-5fe0-ad30-1b7205500a4d', now() - interval '44064 minutes'),
    ('bbebbfa0-3bd7-5762-ac2f-5a08a32a9856', '49033b5b-446d-5796-ac43-ffea0db385d5', 7, 'Request to join', 'As a rider, I want to request a seat, so that the driver can accept me.', 'Given a ride with free seats, when I request one, then the driver sees my request.
