    ('43082e40-bf7b-53d9-a26e-3ec3e8e59da9', '46d3cf9b-db36-57d2-abe4-14ec584a2711', 4, 'Report a lost item', 'As a student who lost something, I want to report it with a photo and where I last saw it, so that a finder can recognise it.', 'Given I''m signed in, when I submit a title, category, place and photo, then the item shows under Lost within 5 seconds.
