Given a missing place, when I submit, then I see which field is missing.', 'must', '0c63c6b7-9418-5cd7-aecd-4e238ccc92d2', now() - interval '47520 minutes'),
    ('b35d7f6b-4269-5436-a86b-761bd3050172', '46d3cf9b-db36-57d2-abe4-14ec584a2711', 8, 'Report a found item', 'As a student who found something, I want to post it with where I left it, so that the owner knows where to collect it.', 'Given I found an item, when I post it with a drop-off point, then it shows under Found with that point.
Given I choose “Keep with me”, when I post, then my contact stays hidden until a claim is approved.', 'must', '0c63c6b7-9418-5cd7-aecd-4e238ccc92d2', now() - interval '46080 minutes'),
    ('51184755-50a2-5c55-a630-a105fc4947cb', '46d3cf9b-db36-57d2-abe4-14ec584a2711', 11, 'Search and filter items', 'As a student, I want to search lost and found items by words, category, place and date, so that I can find my thing in seconds.', 'Given 500 items, when I type “blue bottle”, then matching items show in under 300 ms.
Given a typo like “botle”, when I search, then “bottle” still matches.
Given category and date filters, when I apply both, then only items matching both show.', 'must', '0c63c6b7-9418-5cd7-aecd-4e238ccc92d2', now() - interval '44640 minutes'),
    ('ddd26e76-5234-5ef5-a8a5-08ef882e035c', '46d3cf9b-db36-57d2-abe4-14ec584a2711', 14, 'Item detail page', 'As a student, I want an item page with photo, place, date and status, so that I can decide if it''s mine.', 'Given an item link, when I open it, then I see the photo, place, date and status.
Given a claimed item, when I open it, then the status says Claimed and the claim button is gone.', 'must', '09d253fd-633f-5fda-ab03-e8b722b0534f', now() - interval '43200 minutes'),
    ('eb8360af-8b9f-5fb6-a9fc-c28bb24d2e3f', '46d3cf9b-db36-57d2-abe4-14ec584a2711', 16, 'Claim an item with a secret question', 'As an owner, I want to answer a question only I would know, so that nobody else can claim my item.', 'Given a found item with a secret question, when I answer correctly, then the finder sees my claim and contact.
Given three wrong answers, when I try again, then I am blocked for an hour.', 'should', '7230ec45-53e7-5344-a34e-5ca004d4a0d0', now() - interval '41760 minutes'),
    ('9da0829a-3a3d-5012-a2a0-f2ab73cd131e', '46d3cf9b-db36-57d2-abe4-14ec584a2711', 19, 'Match alerts', 'As someone who lost an item, I want to be told when a matching found item is posted, so that I don''t have to keep checking.', 'Given my lost item is Electronics near the Library, when a found item in the same category and place is posted within 3 days, then I get an alert.
Given I turned alerts off, when a match is posted, then I get nothing.', 'should', '23797133-4b1e-5902-a5de-edd981f4faa7', now() - interval '40320 minutes'),
    ('42addc14-9eec-5085-a01f-f6e2a2192270', '46d3cf9b-db36-57d2-abe4-14ec584a2711', 23, 'Moderation queue for the security office', 'As the campus security office, I want to hide spam or unsafe posts, so that the board stays useful.', 'Given a post reported twice, when I open the queue, then it is at the top.
